{"parse": {"title": "河港与海之间-06", "pageid": 88865, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-05\" title=\"河港与海之间-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">河港与海之间-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-07\" title=\"河港与海之间-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">河港与海之间</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BD.8D.E4.BA.8E.E4.B8.96.E7.95.8C.E4.B8.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"位于世界中\">位于世界中</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 位于世界中</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Into the Vast World</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>看来你不打算改变想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你离开这儿，我们很难再看顾你。万一你生了病，受了伤，遇见了麻烦，我们也没法及时赶来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我会很仔细很仔细的，妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我会给你们写信，等我再经过意大利的时候，我也会回家看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我们不会分开很久，也许隔三五个月就能见一次面，时间很快就过去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这点儿日子还不够您做好一把新的琴呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>……那意味着有三五个月我都没法知道你的近况，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我本来以为你会放弃，因为你放弃过太多东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>一开始你想成为作坊的继承人，后来你要做音乐家，现在你要离开家乡加入游轮乐队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你要学习粘合咒，用它搭小房子，第二天你就把那座房子拆掉，做成了木头风车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你的第一次家庭演奏，临上场前演奏曲目还在不停更换。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你的兴趣总是在变，万一你在船上待腻了，又要怎么办呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>那时你也不能说走就走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>“自由海风号”会定期更改航线，而且总有不同的乘客登船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我能见到很多新鲜东西，他们也会想听不一样的乐曲，我不会随便放弃的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那里不像克雷莫纳一成不变，也没有人固执地认为我应该成为什么样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无需提前演习，她终于自然地说出了自己的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——也下定决心送出了那份临别礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这个送给你们，你和爸爸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我曾经试过仿制一把和“啪唧匣子”同样好的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>但我的确也在中途改变了主意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那时候我觉得自己总有一天会做完它，做得足够好，甚至更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>不久后，我开始上演奏课。我被数不清的声音吸引，开始思考怎么把它们编进乐曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那是我真正想做的事情，和我认为“应该做的事”不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-520914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>即使粘合咒总在失败，即使没有人认可我的“啪唧匣子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我把它做完，是因为我想告诉你们，我的确努力学习过那些课程……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我与“啪唧匣子”在克雷莫纳的每次演奏，都只会被当作小孩子的游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>无论是何种乐曲，何种表演，克雷莫纳人都不会真正地接受它……他们等待着我不再淘气，等待着孩子长大，等待着我回到小提琴的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>妈咪，可……我不想这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我曾经认真地想成为制琴师，现在我想在游轮上为更多人演奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>演奏者应该认清自己的感受，了解自己在世界中的位置，从而把这种感受传递给他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是芭卡洛儿为自己找到的“在世界中的位置”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>这把琴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>边缘的接合处理得有些粗糙，漆面不够均匀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>琴颈比我们给你做的那把要稍直一些，这会让它的声音不如“啪唧匣子”明亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>要当制琴师，你还差着一大截……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>要做一个小小的乐手倒足够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲叹了一口气，但听得出她的话语中暗含着鼓励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>出去看看吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>至少你的姓氏能让你在大多数乐队拥有一席之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>甚至你只用告诉他们你来自克雷莫纳，然后给他们瞧瞧你的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我也不用太担心你要怎么生活，但碰到困难的时候要告诉我们，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>不，妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>不是克雷莫纳的演奏家，也不是斯特拉迪瓦里家族的制琴师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>只是“芭卡洛儿”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>您放心吧，就算不靠这个姓氏，我也有办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>不是斯特拉迪瓦里的某个制琴师难得地出门游历，只是一个普通的孩子离开父母，离开家乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>船什么时候出发？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>三天后。船长说这次我们会去一些新港口，大概一年后再路过意大利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我该出门了，到作坊去。爸爸大概正在忙着，我去见见他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>一年真的很快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>分别并不容易，但新生活离得这样近，只需要迈出步子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离别的不舍最终还是被期待悄悄冲淡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但母亲的呼唤总是能轻轻将一颗心儿拽回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>再稍等一会儿，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我还有一些话……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天色刚刚擦亮，新船员已经提前踏上了甲板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大部分行李已经搬到房间，这是最后一点东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她小心地将两个琴盒靠在角落，这才来得及稍作歇息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>呼……终于。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>毕竟这些是不得不带上的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>反正也就忙这一两回嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>来，我帮你把琴提到房间去。你就趁机在船上走走，熟悉一下。时间还早着，我们中午才离港。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-522002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游轮乐手：</div><div>不用和我客气！之后我还要请你教我演奏技巧呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朋友步子飞快，没给她留下道谢的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她推开离得最近的门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是另一番热闹景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乐声与各种各样的话音盖过了船舱外的风，也盖过了海浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>暖色调的灯光从头顶洒下，让她想起透过教堂彩窗的光线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到此刻，她发觉自己已经真正离开了那片土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教堂，作坊，钟楼，都已经被留在身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>船上有这么多人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这下我不用担心没有听众了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>还好没白费工夫，两个琴盒可是很重的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的嘱托在耳边响起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>带上这把琴一块儿吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>有些曲子，只有用特定的乐器才能达到最好的效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>也许你会碰上最适合它的曲子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>等你找到这首乐曲，在回到克雷莫纳的时候告诉我，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>这么久了，我还没见过你用自己做的琴呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你能这么喜欢“啪唧匣子”，我和你的父亲都非常开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>……多做尝试。最好的乐器是适合自己的乐器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原本是骄傲的宣告，如今是一份温柔的鼓励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲重复了她在家族考试时说出的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>祝你一切顺利，宝贝。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">船员Ⅱ：</div><div>就送到这里吧，妈妈，轮船马上就要出发了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我的孩子……我会想念你的，让我抱抱你，我的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">船员Ⅱ：</div><div>噢，妈妈，别这样，我很快就会回来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“自由海风号”将于中午起航，离岸的人开始了他们最后的道别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>天、天呐，我……我忘了和他们拥抱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我也没有和巴蒂斯塔先生说再见，他这些日子都不在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我还没有把克雷莫纳不同的声音录完……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有声响忽然变得异常嘈杂，如同暴风雨来临时的海浪席卷而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没过她的头顶，让她感受到窒息与陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离别这样冰冷，像铁与雨水，像一段绷紧却无声的琴弦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>不。不该是这样的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她慌乱地转身，冲出了这扇门。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "河港与海之间-06"}}